Z||000000||Alex||04-05-2001||11:00 PM||||Hey guys, especially you guys in California.<BR>I send a couple hunderd bucks worth of Fiero Glassware (www.ashleysmark.com) to the "Fiero Shop" in Richmond CA almost two months ago and since doing that they (George Miller and Terry Owens) will not answer my calls, my e-mails or anything. OK, I was stupid to send this stuff without payment but I have always believed in peoples basic honesty. Did I screw up? Anybody heard anything about the Fiero Shop?<BR>I don't know what else to do except ask for your help.<BR>Thanks<BR>Alex<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||tgowens||04-06-2001||12:20 AM||||Alex, I answered your email tonight and as I have said, I have no legal nor financial responsibility for this shop........I am simply here trying to help out with the work since relocating the shop -- As I also mentioned, there is a toll free number here (866-534-8486) which would be a much better way of handling this matter directly with the owner than bringing it here, don't you agree?||||reg||1
