Z||000003||DXR_DAD||04-06-2001||12:35 AM||||Well looks like we have a problem!!<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/002412.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/002412.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006450.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006450.html</A> <P><B>QUOTE</B>from Terry 3-13-2001<P>theogre has a good point!! We answer the phone at the shop (no voice mail until after hours - and we are usually here late anyway so we even answer it then) and we answer email when we get it..........that's the way a business should be run -- <P>FROM THIS POST! <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006173.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006173.html</A> <P>???????????<BR>DXR_DAD<P>||||reg||5
